ADDED	TCSlib/Cryptography/Obfuscation/StructuredSeed/Correctness.lean:453	TCSlib.Cryptography.Obfuscation.StructuredSeed.Params.G4_seed_allOutputs	theorem	theorem Params.G4_seed_allOutputs (P : Params) (κ : ℕ) (pp : PrimeParam κ) (I : P.Idx' κ pp) : (P.sdSamp' κ pp I).AllOutputs (fun sd => ∀ j, ((P.eval' κ pp I sd j).toNat : ZMod pp.p) = MvPolynomial.eval (Sum.elim sd.1 sd.2) (P.G4 κ pp I j))
